  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Oath of Blood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MissionData
  missionName: Oath of Blood
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  description: 
  flavorText: 'Eyes shine beyond the firelight. Shadows move where no wind blows.
    The predators grow bold with hunger. They circle. They wait. The cries of the
    taken echo through the night. Our people cannot keep living as prey. We must
    kill them before they take our lives.


    We swear the Oath of Blood.'
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f043c74386acceb4f84f864433c875e0, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 66a443d5393e483428c50b6532760f4c, type: 3}
  victoryFlavorText: 'The night grows quieter. Fewer eyes shine beyond the firelight,
    and the howls of predators fade into distant valleys. Broken fangs and scarred
    hides lie as proof of battles fought in darkness and snow. Fear changes its shape
    within the tribe. We no longer wait to be hunted. We strike first. We endure
    because others fall before us.


    We are no longer in dangerous. We are the
    ones who are dangerous.'
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d5dd876a5317ba4cbf90b850234ed97, type: 3}
  failureFlavorText: "Predators still circle the fire. The night is filled with sudden
    cries and the sound of fleeing feet across hard snow. We strike when we can,
    but fear lingers in every shadow. The tribe lives, yet never rests. \n\nThe bitter
    cold is not the only enemy that stalks us in the dark."
  earliestTurn: 0
  latestTurn: 0
